<title>USA: Southwestern PS to take $0.25 Dec qtr charge.</title>
<headline>Southwestern PS to take $0.25 Dec qtr charge.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO, Texas 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwestern Public Service Co said Friday it will record a one-time, after-tax charge of $0.25 per common share for the quarter ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The charge will be recorded to write-off a $16 million investment of its Quixx Corp subsidiary in a waste-to-energy cogeneration project in Fayetteville, N.C., it said.</p>
